      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019d rather see Trump depicted as Jesus in a meme than some fat lesbian",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043564796566487333",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T05:39:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The moment Trump posted that distasteful meme of himself as Jesus Christ, my Christian ethics, many of which I don\u2019t follow, suddenly became my weapon and placed me on the moral high ground.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043540109723640068",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T04:01:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "In his second term so far, Trump, who just mocked Christians by reposting a meme of himself as Jesus Christ, has:\n\n- Created a task force to eradicate anti-Christian bias.\n\n- Established the Religious Liberty Commission.\n\n- Pardoned Christians prosecuted under the FACE Act.\n\n- Ordered guidance to safeguard the right to pray in schools.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043532707267846520",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T03:32:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This was long overdue",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043501477633650690",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T01:28:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Your criticism of the war and the Epstein files doesn\u2019t suddenly make you \n\n- Amplify every negative Trump story.\n\n- TYPE ENTIRE POSTS IN ALL CAPS when bashing him.\n\n- Frame questions about Trump as statements.\n\n- Pretend to read his mind.\n\nYou got something else going on.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043414863481839652",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T19:44:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
