      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Tolerant Left\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/damonimani/status/2043403209843073069",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T18:57:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "damon-imani",
      "voiceName": "Damon Imani",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "After further consideration, I\u2019ve decided to take back my statement. \nI\u2019m sorry to everyone who was personally offended or affected by my words.\n\nVideo",
